PALIMPSEST_TURN {"text":"已完成核查、修订、提交，并通过调度台复核。\n\n**关键结论**\n\n- 现行表 `[80, 40, 70, 50]` **不能直接签发**：01:00–01:30 实测楼宇负荷为 60 kW，可用充电功率只剩 60 kW；70 kW 请求被限到 60 kW，B 车实际只到 **125.5 kWh**，比要求 130 kWh **缺 4.5 kWh**。\n- 修订后的逐格设定为 **`[80, 40, 60, 60]` kW**，保留 **20 kW** 最小楼宇负荷平移（00:30–01:00 → 01:30–02:00）。\n\n| 时段 | 车辆 | 实测楼宇 | 设定 AC | 格末电量 |\n|---|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| 00:00–00:30 | A | 40 kW | 80 kW | 108 kWh |\n| 00:30–01:00 | A | 80 kW | 40 kW | **126 kWh** |\n| 01:00–01:30 | B | 60 kW | 60 kW | 103 kWh |\n| 01:30–02:00 | B | 60 kW | 60 kW | **130 kWh** |\n\n- 离场余量：**A 0 kWh，B 0 kWh**。四格均跑满实测上限，功率余量也为 0；任何效率下降、负荷上升或晚插枪都会直接造成缺口。\n- 低效率放行决定：临界效率 **η = 0.90**。  \n  - **η = 0.90**：刚好达标，可按表放行，但无容错。  \n  - **η = 0.85**：A 到 123 kWh、缺 3 kWh；B 到 127 kWh、缺 3 kWh，**两车均不得放行**。  \n  - η 无法确认 ≥ 0.90 时，按不可放行处理。\n\n**已提交文件**\n\n- `shift-plan.json`：修订后的可执行四格排班\n- `HANDOVER.md`：逐格设定、现行表缺口、离场余量、20 kW 最小平移及低效率放行决定\n\n提交：`e4e60a4e01151e8f250e3d53f713fee18fc7e84c`\n\n复核结果：`node --test` 全部通过；`operations/retest.mjs` 与 `depot_trial` 均显示实际执行 `[80, 40, 60, 60]`、离场 `[126, 130]`、`withinLimits = true`。","toolCalls":["tool/call:palimpsest_continuity","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:depot_directory","tool/result","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/result","tool/result","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:read","tool/call:read","tool/result","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:depot_trial","tool/result","tool/call:depot_trial","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:depot_contact","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:todo_write","tool/result","tool/call:edit","tool/result","tool/call:read","tool/result","tool/call:edit","tool/result","tool/call:write","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:edit","tool/result","tool/call:bash","tool/result","tool/call:edit","tool/result","tool/call:read","tool/result","tool/call:edit","tool/result","tool/cal